{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_984.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"fa4433762b132d8a4fd30679d995bb6f62ac2f5099dba39bd62ca039b23b5c80","ja":"おしるこ美味し～！\nあったまる～～！","zh":"红豆汤真好喝～！\n暖和起来啦～～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_984.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"788f356fb26ac67761fa783956509738e409b0916b374210e045991895339ae2","ja":"これ、青羽さんが作ってくれたんだよね？\nなんだかホッとする味だな……♪","zh":"这是青羽小姐做的，对吧？\n总觉得是让人安心的味道呢……♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_984.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"3a662629713d6752b055d90bd46bea437e6f443dd851c40394c1b8049ed1f12e","ja":"お正月から働いたゴホウビだね。テレビの\n撮影も楽しかったし、今年もいいスタートなの。","zh":"这是从正月开始工作得到的奖励呢。电视拍摄也很开心，今年开了个好头。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_984.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"cca5c9377f4ff3da09cf3a29d4496cf770785e33fab5407317a852f087824dfb","ja":"うん！　新年から全力で体動かせてよかった！\nお正月の鬼ごっこ特番、毎年楽しみなんだー。","zh":"嗯！新年一开始就能全力活动身体，真好！\n我每年都很期待正月的抓鬼特别节目呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_984.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"b9c9aa67eeb622c0298a315fcce31b268894883e57176935a2509aca95f828e4","ja":"海美さんと美希さんが同じチームでよかったな。\nおかげで賞品の高級おせちいっぱい食べれたし♪","zh":"能和海美和美希分在同一个队伍真是太好了。\n多亏了她们，我才能吃到好多高级年节料理♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_984.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"c58a6dedaea69dedcc5f997ab11bbe3347b45487e4d963ecb98e6a0714fdd12b","ja":"黒豆、すっごく味が染みててホクホクだったよね～。\nあんな美味しい黒豆、初めて食べたよー。","zh":"黑豆特别入味，吃起来又香又软糯，对吧～  \n我还是第一次吃到那么好吃的黑豆呢——","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_984.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"28b7814c3ef65c29431e398f195cdbb637182290ba6ad84955b2b37a53ae8600","ja":"ミキは栗きんとんがおいしかったって思うな☆\nいーっぱい食べちゃったの。","zh":"美希觉得栗金团很好吃呢☆  \n一不小心吃了好多哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_984.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"afddc876e443026d7697f31c1b86c2c50aca98772f05c1a685d5b3b1917ba03b","ja":"おせちとおしるこで、もうお腹いっぱい……。\nミキ、眠くなってきちゃった……あふぅ。","zh":"吃了年菜和红豆年糕汤，肚子已经饱饱的了……  \n美希开始困了……啊呼。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_984.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"30603042e238118bdd91378ee62e1d38cedd0c6fe4394606ef1e3f96f1dda5ed","ja":"お腹いっぱいだと眠くなるよね～。\n今日はおせちにおしるこまで食べちゃったし……。","zh":"吃饱了就会犯困呢～。\n今天还吃了年节料理和红豆年糕汤……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_984.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"1a92d8724c5f7035898db88cac2497f9684e2a1fcf8e8fe262b355e0242d1d91","ja":"……あれ？　私たち、食べすぎ！？","zh":"……咦？我们是不是吃太多了！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_984.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"51660005691e7957394ebf3ddb426bfa99da405fd9e1481d353294521bd96cdb","ja":"そうかも？\nお正月っておいしいものばっかりだから。","zh":"或许吧？  \n因为正月里尽是好吃的东西。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_984.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"c9f13d6e92821566a2c4a719458ca5ba158e2524b0deddab094585a81a7ec707","ja":"なんか、食べすぎて体が重くなった気がする！\n軽くする方法は1つしかないよね！","zh":"总觉得吃太多了，身体变沉重了！让身体变轻的方法只有1个，对吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
